{# <twig:c975LBook:Reader:Reader media="{{ images }}" audio="{{ audioMedia }}" id="reader" [cues="{{ [{page: 1, start: 0}, ...] }}"] [cuesFile="{{ book.cues }}"] [title=""] [autoAdvance=true] /> #}
{# The recording is the clock: the controller turns the slider's pages at the cues, and moves the playhead when a page is turned by hand. The cues come inline or as a WebVTT file (BookMediaKind::Cues), each cue's identifier being its page's number - the file wins when both are given #}
{% set cues = cues|default([]) %}
{% if media|length > 0 %}
    <div class="book-reader" data-controller="book-reader" data-book-reader-cues-value="{{ cues|json_encode }}"{% if cuesFile|default(null) %} data-book-reader-cues-url-value="{{ vich_uploader_asset(cuesFile) }}"{% endif %} data-book-reader-auto-advance-value="{{ (autoAdvance|default(true) and audio) ? 'true' : 'false' }}">
        {# Duration 0: nothing else may turn a page while the voice reads #}
        <twig:c975LUi:Slider:Slider media="{{ media }}" id="{{ id }}" duration="0" ratio="free" />
        {% if audio %}
            <twig:c975LUi:Audio:Audio src="{{ vich_uploader_asset(audio) }}" type="{{ audio.mimeType }}" title="{{ title|default('') }}" />
        {% endif %}
    </div>
{% endif %}
